paragraph\" >The world looks different when you are near Olivia. A hidden path might only be visible when you are alone, while a key object might only appear when you are together. Use that to your advantage to solve dynamic puzzles, and find your way out of this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, companion-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bond that empowers you: Olivia isn't a burden to be protected, but the source of your strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful, hand-drawn world with an eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your playstyle: Evade the shadows in tense survival horror, or fight them head-on in fast-paced action combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotional story to tie it all together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save Olivia. Save yourself. Save each other.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tarot the Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783960/221e6f822d225a76e76335300f60230311adf5f6/header.jpg?t=1757430049","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3783960/1973373356/85d9dd74b47f883c071d2f7c478c687d7e750c59/1756918847/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757430047","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3783960/1973373356/85d9dd74b47f883c071d2f7c478c687d7e750c59/1756918847/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757430047","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akama